<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1626009002">
<title>
Radiator Cooling Fan Motor
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect main fan motor connector (1) and sub fan motor connector (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A164013.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "60.835mm" ver = "01" gw = "194" gh = "156"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect each fan motor connector (1) and battery as shown in figure respectively.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFFA0B162006.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "46.634mm" ver = "01" gw = "114" gh = "116"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check each radiator cooling fan motor for smooth rotation and properly. If any abnormality is found, replace corresponding radiator cooling fan motor.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Reference: Fan motor specified current at 12 V
</title>
<ptxt>
Main fan motor: 7.4 – 11.4 A
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Sub fan motor: 7.4 – 11.4 A
</ptxt>
</spec>
